From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WavJaby <WavJaby@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 20:50:27 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] codec2: skip a soft codec library that is not built

C2PlatformComponentStore lists every soft codec of AOSP. ComponentModule::init
treats a listed library that does not dlopen as fatal (LOG_ALWAYS_FATAL_IF), so
the store aborts at its first listing on any ATL build that ships only some
codecs (vorbis, raw; FDK AAC is excluded by licence). The visit loop already
skips a module whose fetch fails, so returning C2_NOT_FOUND is enough.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Patch-Reason: the codec list is compiled into C2Store.cpp; no launcher, loader or property can skip a listed library, and a stub .so for an excluded codec would be a second implementation
---
SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
 media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp | 7 +++++--
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
index 7ca86c161f86d538feac38faf27f5ee34be635ca..7e372b2d811b8fa90197d2d08eddad5f89b98038 100644
--- a/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
+++ b/media/codec2/vndk/C2Store.cpp
@@ -1061,8 +1061,11 @@ c2_status_t C2PlatformComponentStore::ComponentModule::init(
 
     if(!createFactory) {
         mLibHandle = dlopen(libPath.c_str(), RTLD_NOW|RTLD_NODELETE);
-        LOG_ALWAYS_FATAL_IF(mLibHandle == nullptr,
-                "could not dlopen %s: %s", libPath.c_str(), dlerror());
+        if (mLibHandle == nullptr) {
+            // ATL builds only some soft codecs (vorbis, raw); the store lists all of AOSP's, and the visit loop skips a module that fails to load
+            ALOGW("could not dlopen %s: %s", libPath.c_str(), dlerror());
+            return C2_NOT_FOUND;
+        }
 
         createFactory =
             (C2ComponentFactory::CreateCodec2FactoryFunc)dlsym(mLibHandle, "CreateCodec2Factory");
